 "title": "BZT52C2V0S to BZT52C75S: 200 mW silicon zener diodes, 2.0 V to 75 V, SOD-323",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.2",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "Thirty-eight silicon zener diodes for surface mounting, in the two-lead SOD-323 package, rated 200 mW, with nominal zener voltages from 2.0 V to 75 V. Each type is specified for its zener voltage window, impedance at two currents, reverse leakage and temperature coefficient. BZT52C10S is the 10 V type: 9.4 V to 10.6 V at 5 mA, marked WF. Its named uses are voltage references in regulated supplies and overvoltage protection.",
